Package: smartdns-redirect
Version: 0.1.3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: 0xkee
Depends: keenetic-entware-extras, iptables
Recommends: smartdns
Description: Universal DNS DNAT for Keenetic/Entware — redirect LAN :53 to local DNS.
 Intercepts LAN DNS traffic (br0 by default) and redirects to a local DNS
 resolver (SmartDNS :6053 by default; configurable for AGH, Unbound, dnsmasq).
 Keenetic ndnproxy remains intact for the router itself. Latency improvement:
 ~130ms to <80ms measured. NDM-aware: survives iptables flush via
 netfilter.d hook. Compatible with smartdns-ru and geo-split.
Section: net
Priority: optional
